# Telegram crawler session files. The directory is kept via .gitkeep so
# fresh checkouts have a writable session dir, but the session blobs are
# per-environment secrets and must never be committed. Ignore ``*`` inside
# the directory rather than the directory itself so git still descends
# into it and honors the ``.gitkeep`` negation below.
.telegram-sessions/*
!.telegram-sessions/.gitkeep

